<title>FRANCE: EU seen valuing early-Sep French wheat at $185.25.</title>
<headline>EU seen valuing early-Sep French wheat at $185.25.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A European Union award of 147,500 tonnes of free-market soft wheat at a minimum tax of 0.05 Ecus per tonne, in its main tender, values a tonne of French wheat for early September at $185.25 per tonne, Reuters calculates.</p>
</text>
